==Notes==
===Fishing Achievements===
Catching [[Green Algae]], [[White Algae]], [[Seaweed]], [[River Jelly]], [[Sea Jelly]], or [[Cave Jelly]] counts towards the 4 fishing achievements (Fisherman, Ol' Mariner, Master Angler, and Mother Catch). Catching [[Trash]] does not count towards these achievements. Catching the [[Fish#Legendary Fish II|quest fish]] for the [[Quests#Extended Family|Extended Family Qi's quest]] are not required to obtain the Master Angler achievement.

